lease: -- hello: word 2 has HOLD_LEASE
lease: pc sends D5 01 01
lease: pc sends D5 08
lease: CAPS word 2 HOLD_LEASE 1
lease: -- an app before #847: no lease, the holds stay through a minute of silence
lease: pc sends D7 0D 01
hostlink: rx D7 8D 00 01
lease: pc sends D7 14 01 01
hostlink: rx D7 94 00 00 01 01 03
lease: pc quiet 60 s
lease: art key
hostlink: rx D7 8D 01 01
lease: turn 1
hostlink: rx D7 94 01 01 01 01
lease: -- a lease of 30 s; a lease out of range answers 5 and changes nothing; a read
lease: pc sends D7 15 1E
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 00 1E 1E 03
lease: pc sends D7 15 02
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 05 1E 1E 03
lease: pc sends D7 15 79
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 05 1E 1E 03
lease: pc sends D7 15 FF
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 00 1E 1E 03
lease: -- a live app answers each ask (a third of the lease after its last report): held
lease: pc quiet 10 s
hostlink: rx D7 95 01 00 1E 14 03
lease: pc sends D7 15 1E
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 00 1E 1E 03
lease: pc quiet 10 s
hostlink: rx D7 95 01 00 1E 14 03
lease: pc sends D7 15 1E
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 00 1E 1E 03
lease: pc quiet 10 s
hostlink: rx D7 95 01 00 1E 14 03
lease: pc sends D7 15 1E
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 00 1E 1E 03
lease: art key
hostlink: rx D7 8D 01 01
lease: turn 1
hostlink: rx D7 94 01 01 01 01 01
lease: -- existing traffic renews: a report every 8 s, no ask
lease: pc quiet 8 s
lease: pc sends D5 01 01
lease: pc quiet 8 s
lease: pc sends D5 01 01
lease: pc quiet 8 s
lease: pc sends D5 01 01
lease: pc quiet 8 s
lease: pc sends D5 01 01
lease: pc quiet 8 s
lease: pc sends D5 01 01
lease: art key
hostlink: rx D7 8D 01 01
lease: turn 1
hostlink: rx D7 94 01 01 01 01 02
lease: -- the app is killed: asks at 10 and 20 s, every hold let go at 30 s
lease: pc quiet 35 s
hostlink: rx D7 95 01 00 1E 14 03
hostlink: rx D7 95 01 00 1E 0A 03
hostlink: rx D7 95 02 00 1E 00 03 01
lease: art key
lease: board steps 1
lease: turn 1
kp_pressed: usage_page 0x0C keycode 0xE9 implicit_mods 0x00 explicit_mods 0x00
kp_released: usage_page 0x0C keycode 0xE9 implicit_mods 0x00 explicit_mods 0x00
lease: -- the PC's next report hears of the lapse; it takes the holds back
lease: pc sends D5 01 01
hostlink: rx D7 95 02 00 1E 00 03 01
lease: pc sends D7 0D 01
hostlink: rx D7 8D 00 01
lease: pc sends D7 14 01 01
hostlink: rx D7 94 00 00 01 01 03
lease: art key
hostlink: rx D7 8D 01 01
lease: turn 1
hostlink: rx D7 94 01 01 01 01 03
lease: -- nothing held: nothing asked, nothing lapses
lease: pc sends D7 0D 00
hostlink: rx D7 8D
lease: pc sends D7 14 00
hostlink: rx D7 94 00 00 00 00 03
lease: pc quiet 40 s
lease: pc sends D7 15 FF
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 00 1E 00 00 01
lease: -- the lease off (D7 15 00): a hold stays through silence
lease: pc sends D7 15 00
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 00 00 00 00 01
lease: pc sends D7 0D 01
hostlink: rx D7 8D 00 01
lease: pc quiet 40 s
lease: art key
hostlink: rx D7 8D 01 01
lease: -- master volume (#855, D7 16) is a held mode too: asked for, and it lapses (mask 04)
lease: pc sends D7 0D 00
hostlink: rx D7 8D
lease: pc sends D7 15 1E
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 00 1E 00 00 01
lease: pc sends D7 16 01
hostlink: rx D7 96 00 00 01
lease: turn 1
hostlink: rx D7 94 01 01 01 00 04
lease: pc quiet 35 s
hostlink: rx D7 95 01 00 1E 14 04 01
hostlink: rx D7 95 01 00 1E 0A 04 01
hostlink: rx D7 95 02 00 1E 00 04 02
lease: turn 1
