kp_released: usage_page 0x0C keycode 0xE9 implicit_mods 0x00 explicit_mods 0x00
lease: pc sends D7 16 FF
hostlink: rx D7 96
hostlink: rx D7 95 02 00 1E 00 04 02
lease: pc sends D7 16 01
hostlink: rx D7 96 00 00 01
lease: turn 1
hostlink: rx D7 94 01 01 01 00 05
lease: pc sends D7 16 00
hostlink: rx D7 96
lease: pc sends D7 0D 01
hostlink: rx D7 8D 00 01
lease: -- the link drops (an endpoint change): the holds and the lease go
lease: pc sends D7 15 1E
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 00 1E 1E 01 02
lease: the endpoint changes
lease: pc sends D7 15 FF
hostlink: rx D7 95 00 00 00 00 00 02
lease: art key
lease: board steps 1
lease: -- done
